WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.140
What did that championship mean to you personally?

2
00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:11.480
Was that a crowning achievement or was that . . . How do you remember that?

3
00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:19.500
It’s . . . I remember it as one of the . . . one of the biggest things in my life.

4
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:24.660
And actually it becomes bigger as the years go on.

5
00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:27.840
It’s bigger now than it was when it happened.

6
00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:31.020
I wouldn’t take anything for it.

7
00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:36.780
It was a tremendous experience.

8
00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:40.840
National championships are awful hard to come by.

9
00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:43.220
So I’ve been very proud of it.

10
00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:46.760
It’s one of the great memories of my life.

11
00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:48.320
What do you think it meant to the players?

12
00:00:48.320 --> 00:01:02.700
Well, I’m sure that it gave all of them a sense of pride and endeared LSU to them.
